id: clock_manager_oscillator_config_override
label: Clock Manager Oscillator Configuration (Bootloader Override)
package: bootloader
description: >
  Bootloader-oriented Clock Manager oscillator CMSIS configuration for SiWx301 (Series 3).
  Contributes an override of the Clock Manager oscillator config slot (same mechanism as
  board packages): the generated sl_clock_manager_oscillator_config.h replaces the default
  Clock Manager template when this component is installed, without changing clock_manager.slcc.
  Board packages that list unless clock_manager_oscillator_config_override on their Clock
  Manager oscillator entries will skip their board file when this component is present.
  Required by Bootloader Core (Series-3) for SiWx301 devices; also requires Clock Manager.
  In Simplicity Studio the settings
  are edited under the Clock Manager component (override target), not as a separate file
  entry on this component.
category: Platform|Bootloader|Core
quality: production
root_path: bootloader/platform/bootloader/series3/config/device_series_3/
config_file:
# Series-3
- path: sl_clock_manager_oscillator_config.h
  override:
    component: clock_manager
    file_id: clock_manager_oscillator_config
    vendor: silabs
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
provides:
- name: clock_manager_oscillator_config_override
